==English==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|infectus|lang=la}}, perfect passive participle of {{term|inficio|inficiō|dye, taint|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɛkt}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{transitive}} to bring into contact with a substance that can cause illness (a [[pathogen]])
# {{transitive}} to make somebody enthusiastic about one's own passion
#: ''Her passion for dancing has '''infected''' me.''

====Antonyms====
* [[disinfect]]

====Derived terms====
* [[infection]]

====Related terms====
* [[infectious]]

